WEBVTT

00:05.230 --> 00:06.540
It's a tie?

00:11.240 --> 00:12.570
Time out!

00:13.910 --> 00:15.740
Tomoka, it's time for phase two.

00:15.740 --> 00:18.280
Pass the ball around, and try to stall for time.

00:18.700 --> 00:21.200
It'd be great if could you manage to stall for thirty seconds.

00:21.200 --> 00:22.830
I understand.

00:22.830 --> 00:23.830
Airi.

00:23.830 --> 00:25.080
You don't have to attack anymore.

00:25.080 --> 00:27.500
I want you to defend our own hoop this time.

00:27.500 --> 00:29.420
I need you to go after rebounds aggressively.

00:29.420 --> 00:30.460
Yes!

00:30.460 --> 00:33.800
Maho and Saki, try to pass to Tomoka as much as possible.

00:33.800 --> 00:34.630
Yes!

00:34.630 --> 00:36.090
Oh~!

00:36.090 --> 00:38.300
Onii-chan, what about Hina?

00:38.300 --> 00:41.350
Hinata-chan, just shout loudly when the time comes.

00:41.350 --> 00:43.640
Listen carefully for my voice.

00:43.640 --> 00:45.140
Got it.

00:45.140 --> 00:45.940
All right!

00:45.940 --> 00:47.560
Everyone, let's go!

00:48.520 --> 00:50.020
Yes!

00:48.520 --> 00:50.020
Yes~!

00:59.030 --> 01:02.370
Don't give up and do your best

01:02.370 --> 01:05.750
Try your luck and fight! Chin-up!

01:05.750 --> 01:08.790
I know perfectly

01:08.790 --> 01:12.460
How weak a person is on their own

01:12.670 --> 01:15.630
Things that are on the verge of being lost

01:15.630 --> 01:19.300
I hold them close to my chest

01:19.300 --> 01:22.270
Your gentle words

01:22.270 --> 01:26.230
Caress my cheeks

01:26.230 --> 01:29.270
The irritation that has been building up

01:29.270 --> 01:32.070
From wanting to reach the goal

01:32.070 --> 01:36.240
My heart that almost wants to burst out crying

01:36.240 --> 01:39.820
The place that warms it up

01:39.820 --> 01:42.740
Even if we have to go through the pain

01:42.740 --> 01:46.250
We have to protect this

01:47.710 --> 01:49.630
We won't lose now

01:49.630 --> 01:53.000
We will raise our small hands up in the air

01:53.000 --> 01:56.420
Take in that vital power, embrace it

01:56.420 --> 01:59.890
Then release it towards the sky!

01:59.890 --> 02:01.430
The courage that cannot be stopped

02:01.430 --> 02:03.260
Tomorrow we'll jump and shoot!

02:03.260 --> 02:06.180
I will pass the ball to you

02:06.180 --> 02:10.480
The memories that are awoken by our calls

02:10.480 --> 02:14.030
Game

02:10.480 --> 02:14.030
Will move the game along

02:20.410 --> 02:24.450
Wish Upon Subaru

02:46.310 --> 02:47.640
Everyone...

02:48.390 --> 02:51.350
Looks like passing around to stall for time won't work.

03:04.240 --> 03:05.450
Rebound!

03:08.580 --> 03:10.160
Yes! Nice rebound!

03:10.160 --> 03:11.620
There are three minutes left!

03:11.620 --> 03:12.290
They can do it!

03:13.580 --> 03:14.920
Last phase.

03:14.920 --> 03:16.500
It's time for our ace!

03:26.140 --> 03:27.560
We did it!

03:30.770 --> 03:32.600
This feels good!

03:44.320 --> 03:45.320
Amazing!

03:45.320 --> 03:46.870
She scored from so far away!

03:49.620 --> 03:50.290
Hey!

03:50.290 --> 03:51.250
Pass it here!

03:51.250 --> 03:52.600
I'll attack!

03:53.420 --> 03:54.920
Do it, Hinata-chan!

03:54.920 --> 03:56.290
Shut down Takenaka!

03:56.290 --> 03:58.550
Oh~!

04:03.630 --> 04:04.890
What are you doing?!

04:04.890 --> 04:06.890
Hurry up and shoot!

04:06.890 --> 04:08.810
Oh~!

04:08.810 --> 04:09.680
Oww...

04:10.430 --> 04:11.640
Hey!

04:12.690 --> 04:13.600
Charging!

04:13.600 --> 04:15.310
Blue team, number four!

04:15.310 --> 04:17.820
Hey, he didn't bump into her, right?

04:18.940 --> 04:22.610
I'm making use of Hinata-chan's Innocent Charm.

04:23.490 --> 04:28.700
If Takenaka gets close to you, could you try to fall?

04:28.700 --> 04:30.240
Ah~!

04:30.540 --> 04:35.580
Basically, you're taking advantage of
Takenaka's love to make him foul her.

04:35.580 --> 04:38.210
I think it's cheating, though...

04:38.210 --> 04:39.090
I understand.

04:39.420 --> 04:41.540
This isn't the time to worry about that, right?

04:43.590 --> 04:45.050
All right!

04:45.720 --> 04:46.720
Seems like it didn't work.

04:46.720 --> 04:50.100
As I thought, he really is their ace.

04:50.100 --> 04:53.020
These distractions won't fool him forever.

05:17.750 --> 05:19.540
Full-court press, huh?

05:22.800 --> 05:23.460
Damn!

05:31.930 --> 05:33.680
Illegal use of hands!

05:34.020 --> 05:35.600
Blue team, number five!

05:42.480 --> 05:43.860
You did it, Mo-kan!

05:43.860 --> 05:45.030
We finally overtook them!

05:46.030 --> 05:47.360
Just a little more...

05:47.360 --> 05:48.820
Please hold out.

06:00.330 --> 06:02.250
They overtook us again.

06:02.250 --> 06:03.250
Takenaka!

06:03.250 --> 06:04.670
Do your triple team!

06:19.360 --> 06:21.690
It's our victory, Minato.

06:22.650 --> 06:24.610
There's...

06:24.940 --> 06:27.280
There's no way I'll lose!

06:27.650 --> 06:29.450
That's nothing!

06:30.320 --> 06:31.370
That's because I...!

06:32.660 --> 06:33.780
Teach me, Mo-kan!

06:33.780 --> 06:34.700
I'll try my best, too!

06:34.700 --> 06:35.290
Yeah!

06:35.290 --> 06:35.870
I'll try my best!

06:35.870 --> 06:37.330
Let's win tomorrow! For sure!

06:39.030 --> 06:41.460
I'm with everyone now!

06:48.010 --> 06:49.800
Leave it to me, Mo-kan!

06:52.590 --> 06:54.760
Go!

07:07.740 --> 07:09.820
The match is over!

07:10.180 --> 07:11.610
We did it!

07:11.910 --> 07:12.660
We did it!

07:12.660 --> 07:13.660
We won!

07:13.660 --> 07:15.030
I'm glad!

07:18.290 --> 07:20.870
I'm so glad!

07:29.440 --> 07:31.010
Damn.

07:31.800 --> 07:33.300
We won! We won!

07:33.300 --> 07:36.260
Thanks for your hard work, Subaru.

07:37.810 --> 07:39.910
I didn't do anything.

07:47.230 --> 07:49.230
To celebrate the girls' basketball club's victory...

07:49.230 --> 07:51.030
Cheers!

07:52.070 --> 07:53.610
Everyone really did a good job.

07:53.610 --> 07:54.620
Congratulations!

07:54.620 --> 07:56.530
Now our club won't be dissolved.

07:56.530 --> 07:58.740
It's all thanks to Subaru's coaching!

07:58.740 --> 08:00.950
Thank you very much!

08:00.950 --> 08:03.370
Thank you, Onii-chan.

08:03.370 --> 08:06.790
I just helped out for a bit.

08:06.790 --> 08:10.380
I never could've imagined that you'd pull off that last shot.

08:10.380 --> 08:13.930
I assumed Tomoka was going to shoot, too.

08:14.430 --> 08:15.550
Really?

08:15.550 --> 08:18.060
We were thinking that Maho would move to that spot.

08:18.060 --> 08:19.310
Oh~!

08:19.310 --> 08:20.930
Hina thought so, too!

08:20.930 --> 08:22.940
Isn't that right, Mo-kan?

08:22.940 --> 08:23.520
Yes.

08:23.520 --> 08:25.730
I was thinking that Maho would run to that spot, too.

08:26.440 --> 08:27.310
Why?

08:27.310 --> 08:29.530
"Why?" you ask...

08:29.530 --> 08:32.110
We can only say we just kind of... knew.

08:32.110 --> 08:35.950
Well, girls just have a mysterious link between them.

08:35.950 --> 08:37.530
I also had it in the past.

08:38.160 --> 08:39.740
Miho-nee, you had friends?!

08:41.830 --> 08:44.870
Well, everyone really tried their best.

08:46.290 --> 08:49.590
Um, thank you very, very much.

08:50.170 --> 08:55.120
If Hasegawa-san hadn't encouraged me,

08:55.120 --> 08:58.260
I don't think I would've been able
to try my best as a Small Forward.

08:58.260 --> 08:59.720
Thank you so much!

09:03.520 --> 09:04.180
Sorry!

09:05.190 --> 09:06.600
Um...

09:06.940 --> 09:08.230
Sorry, Airi!

09:08.230 --> 09:10.150
I lied to you.

09:14.900 --> 09:17.950
So I wasn't the Small...

09:17.950 --> 09:19.910
I was the Big Man-

09:18.570 --> 09:19.910
I'm really sorry!

09:19.910 --> 09:22.240
But I didn't have anyone else to rely on besides you, Airi!

09:23.450 --> 09:26.120
We really needed you, Airi!

09:26.500 --> 09:31.210
I didn't think you would forgive me, but I just want you to believe me.

09:35.800 --> 09:38.680
Airi, you honestly tried very hard for us.

09:38.680 --> 09:41.600
Even though you were afraid of the ball, you managed to face your fear.

09:42.060 --> 09:45.970
That courage was really, really amazing!

09:45.970 --> 09:46.810
Yes...

09:46.810 --> 09:51.190
I think Airi is a really wonderful girl, too.

09:52.650 --> 09:53.730
Wow!

09:53.730 --> 09:56.530
Subarun proposed to Airi!

09:56.530 --> 09:57.360
Maho!

09:57.360 --> 09:58.490
Calm down!

09:58.490 --> 09:59.950
This is a huge development!

10:00.530 --> 10:02.660
Ah, no, I didn't mean it that way!

10:04.500 --> 10:06.830
Tomoka, are you feeling sick?

10:06.830 --> 10:09.580
Mo-kan suddenly got sick!

10:09.580 --> 10:10.580
No, I didn't!

10:11.420 --> 10:13.000
This has gotten interesting.

10:13.380 --> 10:14.760
Okay!

10:14.760 --> 10:17.720
It's the Hasegawa speciality: meat loaf!

10:17.720 --> 10:19.430
Huh? What happened?

10:19.430 --> 10:20.760
Listen, Nayu-chi!

10:20.760 --> 10:21.600
Subaru just-

10:21.600 --> 10:24.180
I told you, it's just a misunderstanding!

10:29.650 --> 10:32.310
It's still kind of cold to be lighting fireworks.

10:32.310 --> 10:34.530
It's perfectly fine, Mii-tan.

10:34.530 --> 10:35.480
It's beautiful.

10:35.480 --> 10:36.570
Oh~!

10:40.110 --> 10:41.030
Huh?

10:45.950 --> 10:50.500
Subaru-san, could you continue to be our coach?

10:50.500 --> 10:53.320
I'm happy you said that,

10:53.320 --> 10:58.670
but I think a proper coach would be better than a novice like me.

10:58.670 --> 11:03.380
But the reason we won is because Subaru-san taught us!

11:04.220 --> 11:08.810
I want to learn more from Subaru-san.

11:09.640 --> 11:11.560
I'll do anything!

11:13.270 --> 11:15.320
Then, how about this?

11:15.320 --> 11:20.740
If Tomoka makes fifty free throws in a row, Subaru will continue coaching.

11:20.740 --> 11:22.360
Fifty free throws in a row?!

11:22.360 --> 11:24.660
Even for Tomoka, that's obviously impossible!

11:24.660 --> 11:25.620
Really?

11:25.620 --> 11:27.580
I thought it was a good idea.

11:28.660 --> 11:30.120
Fifty free throws...

11:30.430 --> 11:32.580
No matter how you look at it, that's way overboard.

11:32.580 --> 11:33.540
Sorry about that.

11:33.540 --> 11:36.800
You don't need to take what Miho-nee is saying seriously.

12:04.660 --> 12:05.450
All right!

12:05.450 --> 12:08.490
My, you started practising again?

12:09.540 --> 12:11.290
Is it because of those girls?

12:12.000 --> 12:14.750
It's not like that...!

12:14.750 --> 12:18.500
If I don't practise, I'll get rusty, so it can't be helped.

12:18.500 --> 12:19.840
Sure, sure.

12:21.590 --> 12:22.380
Coming!

12:29.060 --> 12:31.480
My, Tomoka-chan!

12:33.730 --> 12:34.770
Tomoka?

12:36.100 --> 12:37.400
Good morning!

12:38.020 --> 12:39.730
Um, what's the matter?

12:40.860 --> 12:41.900
Fifty free throws...

12:42.690 --> 12:45.950
I'll try my best to achieve my goal of fifty free throws!

12:45.950 --> 12:47.370
Please give me a chance.

12:48.200 --> 12:49.490
Okay...

12:57.830 --> 12:59.250
Amazing.

12:59.250 --> 13:00.800
The rest is up to her luck.

13:03.510 --> 13:06.260
Her form is beautiful, as always.

13:07.760 --> 13:11.310
Um, was there something strange about my form?

13:11.310 --> 13:13.270
No, nothing's wrong.

13:13.270 --> 13:14.020
Continue.

13:14.020 --> 13:15.100
Yes.

13:24.570 --> 13:26.910
I guess I still need a lot more practice.

13:26.910 --> 13:28.870
I'll try again tomorrow.

13:28.870 --> 13:30.030
Tomorrow?

13:30.030 --> 13:32.790
Come to think of it, my term hasn't been decided yet.

13:32.790 --> 13:34.580
Yes, I'll try my best!

13:35.870 --> 13:37.600
How long will she keep this up...?

13:42.420 --> 13:47.380
Well, it's actually a good thing to be able to see that beautiful form every day.

13:47.380 --> 13:49.140
What are you so happy about?

13:49.140 --> 13:50.390
Lolicon prince.

13:53.970 --> 13:58.150
Gosh, I've told you to stop using those stupid nicknames.

13:58.900 --> 14:02.230
You're as powerful as ever, Aoi.

14:02.860 --> 14:03.940
You...

14:03.940 --> 14:07.450
Did you know that Subaru could clearly see your panties from that position?

14:08.280 --> 14:09.360
Did you see them?

14:09.950 --> 14:12.280
I didn't!

14:13.240 --> 14:14.290
You saw!

14:14.290 --> 14:15.830
You pervert!

14:18.250 --> 14:19.500
A get-together?

14:19.500 --> 14:20.250
That's right.

14:20.580 --> 14:23.960
We can round up people who are interested and play basketball.

14:23.960 --> 14:27.550
Well, for now we just have to try it out and see how it goes.

14:27.550 --> 14:31.050
If you don't do anything for a whole year, you'll get rusty, right?

14:31.050 --> 14:35.560
We decided this after you went
home that day at the batting centre.

14:35.560 --> 14:36.930
You guys...

14:36.930 --> 14:37.730
Anyway...

14:37.730 --> 14:39.010
Give me that!

14:41.690 --> 14:44.780
We're going to practise right after school.

14:44.780 --> 14:45.610
Yeah!

14:47.490 --> 14:49.910
Subaru's not coming anymore.

14:49.910 --> 14:51.450
It's going to be really lonely.

14:51.450 --> 14:52.660
That's right.

14:52.660 --> 14:54.120
Onii-chan...

14:54.120 --> 14:57.540
Tomo tried to persuade him to keep coaching us, but it didn't work.

14:58.250 --> 15:02.130
But still, I'll try my best to get him back.

15:02.130 --> 15:04.210
What do you mean, "try your best"?

15:05.340 --> 15:09.550
I want to tell everyone, but it might not work out,

15:09.550 --> 15:11.380
so could I keep it a secret for now?

15:12.220 --> 15:15.890
So Mo-kan, you're planning to give him a woman's most important thing?

15:15.890 --> 15:17.220
What are you saying?!

15:17.220 --> 15:18.810
Do you even know what that means?!

15:18.810 --> 15:19.520
Yup.

15:19.520 --> 15:20.890
I can give him mine, too.

15:20.890 --> 15:22.400
My stuffed toy Alpaca.

15:23.520 --> 15:24.690
I see...

15:24.690 --> 15:28.740
Tomoka-chan, tell us whenever you can.

15:28.740 --> 15:30.030
Oh~!

15:30.030 --> 15:32.200
Do your best, Tomoka.

15:32.200 --> 15:33.410
I will.

15:33.410 --> 15:35.030
Thank you, everyone.

15:40.250 --> 15:42.670
I won't be tricked by that move anymore.

15:43.460 --> 15:44.330
I guess not.

15:50.920 --> 15:53.010
Well, we have been friends for a long time.

15:54.640 --> 15:56.680
Hasegawa-sensei!

15:56.680 --> 15:58.850
Could you teach these kids here?

15:58.850 --> 16:00.980
We just can't seem to get it right.

16:00.980 --> 16:02.850
Sure! I'm coming!

16:09.610 --> 16:10.940
That was tiring.

16:10.940 --> 16:13.240
So, you really have gotten rusty, eh?

16:14.870 --> 16:18.030
Hey, why don't you join the basketball club, Aoi?

16:18.030 --> 16:20.950
At your level, you'd make a strong player for a high schooler.

16:21.830 --> 16:26.840
I can't seem to get taller, and...

16:26.840 --> 16:28.670
There are lots of reasons.

16:29.670 --> 16:33.510
As for you, you seem to have gotten really good at taking care of people.

16:33.510 --> 16:37.050
You were teaching that new girl so nicely, weren't you?

16:37.050 --> 16:41.100
In the past, you taught guys but not girls
because you said you were bad with them.

16:42.180 --> 16:45.810
Maybe my interests changed when I entered high school.

16:46.980 --> 16:48.360
What's up with that?

16:58.040 --> 16:59.870
Three more shots.

17:07.960 --> 17:12.550
One, two, three, four...

17:18.390 --> 17:21.100
It was just an unlucky shot.

17:21.100 --> 17:23.640
If it's fine with you, Tomoka, you can come in the evening, too.

17:25.270 --> 17:26.560
Yes!

17:26.560 --> 17:29.020
Tomoka-chan, how has it been going since then?

17:29.020 --> 17:32.230
Well, it hasn't been going too well...

17:32.230 --> 17:33.570
I see.

17:33.570 --> 17:36.610
Is there anything Hina can do to help?

17:36.610 --> 17:38.450
Nope, it's fine.

17:38.450 --> 17:41.030
Tomorrow, I'll try my best to succeed.

17:41.030 --> 17:43.910
You're all pumped up, Mo-kan!

17:43.910 --> 17:45.870
Don't push yourself too hard, though.

17:45.870 --> 17:48.630
Tomo, we're cheering for you.

17:48.630 --> 17:51.420
Thank you, everyone.

17:53.460 --> 17:57.630
If only there were something I could do to help Tomoka...

17:58.640 --> 17:59.510
That's it!

17:59.510 --> 18:00.930
Subaru!

18:00.930 --> 18:04.060
About the get-together today...

18:04.060 --> 18:06.690
Sorry, I'm a little busy today.

18:06.690 --> 18:08.350
Do you have something to do?

18:08.350 --> 18:10.310
I'll make up for it next week.

18:14.610 --> 18:16.030
Just a few more.

18:20.070 --> 18:23.620
I'll show you something that might help.

18:27.210 --> 18:31.290
I gathered lots of interviews of different players.

18:31.790 --> 18:34.250
I thought it might be able to help you.

18:39.380 --> 18:41.090
That's amazing!

18:41.090 --> 18:43.760
This is the Japanese National Team playing, right?

18:43.760 --> 18:45.560
At last year's World Championships!

18:45.560 --> 18:47.850
I'm surprised that you know.

18:47.850 --> 18:50.350
I try to watch lots of different games.

18:50.350 --> 18:52.190
It's good study material.

18:53.400 --> 18:54.690
That move was fast!

18:54.690 --> 18:57.320
No matter how many times I watch it, it sure is amazing.

18:59.610 --> 19:02.870
Do you think it's of any help?

19:02.870 --> 19:05.330
Yes, thank you very much.

19:06.750 --> 19:10.370
Although, it would be great if I could somehow make fifty free throws...

19:11.920 --> 19:13.250
If it's you, Tomoka, you can do it.

19:14.130 --> 19:17.760
I was going to tell you to stop doing this,

19:17.760 --> 19:21.590
but I don't want to stop watching you shoot.

19:22.510 --> 19:26.220
Although this seems weird coming from me, you can do it, Tomoka.

19:28.350 --> 19:29.310
Yes!

20:03.510 --> 20:04.890
It started raining.

20:04.890 --> 20:06.100
Tomoka!

20:17.940 --> 20:18.780
Do your best.

20:21.240 --> 20:27.490
Before I noticed, Tomoka had removed the cloud of uneasiness from my heart.

20:28.620 --> 20:33.460
It's almost like a flower that blooms after the rain.

20:38.670 --> 20:39.960
Subaru-san.

20:40.880 --> 20:42.010
The next shot is the last one.

20:43.340 --> 20:44.510
Yes.

21:00.400 --> 21:02.740
Shiny Gift.

21:08.580 --> 21:10.910
Infirmary

21:09.030 --> 21:10.910
Shiny Gift?

21:10.910 --> 21:11.620
That's right.

21:11.620 --> 21:13.960
That's the second name Subaru gave Tomoka.

21:13.960 --> 21:16.080
He said it means a flower that blooms after the rain.

21:16.500 --> 21:21.250
Thanks to Tomoka's hard work, Subaru is able to play basketball again.

21:21.710 --> 21:26.550
For him, meeting Tomoka might have been a gift from the heavens.

21:26.550 --> 21:32.810
"Gift" also can mean "talent", so it might be referring to Tomoka-chan's talent.

21:36.740 --> 21:40.040
Well, it's pretty well thought-out on Subaru's part.

21:42.030 --> 21:43.530
"I'm back"?

21:43.530 --> 21:45.780
Or should I say, "Pleased to meet you"?

21:46.450 --> 21:48.820
Well, I guess it doesn't really matter.

21:51.910 --> 21:55.040
Welcome back, darling!

21:55.160 --> 21:57.960
♪Party love Party love Party love (fuufuu)

22:00.960 --> 22:03.510
I want to grow up quickly (Yes-!)

22:13.220 --> 22:14.560
Come on! Come on!

22:14.560 --> 22:17.310
If I'm small, if I stay small

22:17.310 --> 22:19.810
You say there's virtue in it.

22:19.810 --> 22:21.400
But that's a lie!

22:21.400 --> 22:22.480
You're just trying to console me, right?

22:22.770 --> 22:25.110
I want to grow up faster!

22:25.530 --> 22:28.200
Drink milk, drink soy milk

22:28.200 --> 22:30.910
You say that the shrimp there is good.

22:30.910 --> 22:32.280
Triple A

